Explain the potential risks of this tool call:

**Tool:** Write
**Input:**
```
{"file_path":"<tmp>","content":"use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};

#[derive(Debug)]
pub struct User {
    pub id: u64,
    pub name: String,
}

/// Body of a request that carries an auth token (e.g. `POST /protected`).
#[derive(Debug, Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]
pub struct AuthRequest {
    pub token: String,
}
"}
```

What could go wrong if this executes?
